 2x, https://si.imgix.net/76bf2ac3/uploads/origins/4e5eb0a4-d814-4a4b-894f-852530b024c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38c49b52da32d43e1ab2909c622330f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would love to request a drawing from you! The drawing is my OC: \"Woodbruh\". \nHe is a tan tree boy. His personality is friendly and relaxed. \n\nPose and emotions can be up to you ^^\n\n\nI would like a transparent file as well if possible!  Thank you!\n\nhttps://vsona.co/woodbruh", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKYB2000/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4f9ad745/uploads/origins/ef086720-5884-4e93-890c-d72b7310d0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bd49cfd3124504db1e3a19a31c3398b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4f9ad745/uploads/origins/ef086720-5884-4e93-890c-d72b7310d0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bd49cfd3124504db1e3a19a31c3398b, https://si.imgix.net/4f9ad745/uploads/origins/ef086720-5884-4e93-890c-d72b7310d0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=676e130fcc5bf01705934936eb0535c0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4f9ad745/uploads/origins/ef086720-5884-4e93-890c-d72b7310d0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a7b8dfbc368612191bf58362e743612 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi again, it's me! <3 I absolutely love your work!! Could I request an illustration of my tan-skinned original character “Charlotte the Knight” holding her Claymore sword?\n\nFeel free to choose any pose and expression!\n\nhttps://vsona.co/charlotte-the-knight/charlotte-brunhilda/gallery/full-body-chibi/e40bd16d-ff4f-4436-897e-e8401b9d7ce6\n\nI'll be using it on Twitch and Twitter, so please provide a transparent file. Thank you for your wonderful work, and I look forward to working with you again C:! <3\n\nhttps://vsona.co/charlotte-the-knight", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKYB2000/works/57", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f62a922/uploads/origins/b0235337-bbfb-4947-ac6f-ec8fc3e1b7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dfe0be93a7eeca33f472a9241bc137e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f62a922/uploads/origins/b0235337-bbfb-4947-ac6f-ec8fc3e1b7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dfe0be93a7eeca33f472a9241bc137e, https://si.imgix.net/7f62a922/uploads/origins/b0235337-bbfb-4947-ac6f-ec8fc3e1b7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dae55d528a46e85feceb6f94df3a8c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f62a922/uploads/origins/b0235337-bbfb-4947-ac6f-ec8fc3e1b7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18a694686445a9b2dc25aa46d18c1684 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のオリジナルキャラクター（OC）のイラストを依頼したいです。お好きなように描いてください。どうもありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fj_gKGB1BEQiz-fdBSb1gVaoubdD1C0m?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKYB2000/works/56", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/30f02a9d/uploads/origins/d5f19c90-efa2-4ebb-8997-265120eaa97c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cb5d370cdf9335e1a9f650f0243d7df", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/30f02a9d/uploads/origins/d5f19c90-efa2-4ebb-8997-265120eaa97c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cb5d370cdf9335e1a9f650f0243d7df, https://si.imgix.net/30f02a9d/uploads/origins/d5f19c90-efa2-4ebb-8997-265120eaa97c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e152f0335d1f391ffd69a7ae632d73ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/30f02a9d/uploads/origins/d5f19c90-efa2-4ebb-8997-265120eaa97c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9c36999940b38ce5b150fc7e1f1aa93 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello its me again! <3 I love your art so much !! I would love for you to draw my character \"Gigi the Goblin.\" She's very sweet and loves gold! She also carries a very BIG backpack. However, the backpack is optional. \n\nThe pose and expression is up to you (:\n\nThank you so much again 🥺💖\n\nhttps://vgen.co/c/angie-the-goblin", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKYB2000/works/55", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/46b34e6d/uploads/origins/4a2a0f21-d51b-482b-8d4d-0ee37b44fcec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c59d962e59bc7f126a2445e0170e6b58", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46b34e6d/uploads/origins/4a2a0f21-d51b-482b-8d4d-0ee37b44fcec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c59d962e59bc7f126a2445e0170e6b58, https://si.imgix.net/46b34e6d/uploads/origins/4a2a0f21-d51b-482b-8d4d-0ee37b44fcec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d285ca9ffdce7bf098961b568bba2e7d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46b34e6d/uploads/origins/4a2a0f21-d51b-482b-8d4d-0ee37b44fcec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c22454a3fdb89363901146e61151825d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！はじめまして！\n\nこちらのキャラクター「イリヤ」を描いていただけたらとても嬉しいです！\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/21ye9134ee3j\n\nイリヤはバレンタインが大好きないちごウミウシです！手作りのチョコやお菓子を作るのが大得意なんです。🍫🍓💝\n\nどんな風に描いていただいても大歓迎です！ご検討いただけましたら嬉しいです。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKYB2000/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/52a74f89/uploads/origins/44c57aa6-81dd-4666-b0f1-99fc06d20733?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcb4d0687c4c63891fb71d466c15fc60", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52a74f89/uploads/origins/44c57aa6-81dd-4666-b0f1-99fc06d20733?bg=%23